the</span> <span begin="13.415" end="14.033">memory</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重温你曾见过的一切，重拾那些回忆</span></p><p begin="14.230" end="17.465" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.230" end="14.395">The</span> <span begin="14.395" end="14.775">jour</span><span begin="14.775" end="15.935">ney,</span> <span begin="15.935" end="16.178">with</span> <span begin="16.256" end="17.465">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与我一同踏上旅途</span></p><p begin="18.208" end="20.881" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.208" end="18.303">A</span> <span begin="18.398" end="19.086">dance</span> <span begin="19.086" end="19.246">at</span> <span begin="19.246" end="19.361">the</span> <span begin="19.361" end="20.036">end</span> <span begin="20.036" end="20.196">of</span> <span begin="20.196" end="20.356">a</span> <span begin="20.356" end="20.881">dream</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在梦境尽头起舞</span></p><p begin="21.087" end="25.172" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.087" end="21.297">A</span> <span begin="21.297" end="21.660">branch</span> <span begin="21.660" end="21.820">of</span> <span begin="21.905" end="22.137">his</span><span begin="22.137" end="23.137">tory</span> <span begin="23.137" end="23.457">no</span> <span begin="23.457" end="23.831">one</span> <span begin="24.120" end="24.246">will</span> <span begin="24.277" end="24.678">ever</span> <span begin="24.678" end="25.172">see</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那是无人得见的一段历史分支</span></p><p begin="25.561" end="28.954" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.561" end="25.667">The</span> <span begin="25.766" end="26.238">golden</span> <span begin="26.238" end="26.978">starlight,</span> <span begin="26.978" end="27.138">just</span> <span begin="27.138" end="27.298">like</span> <span begin="27.298" end="28.025">fireworks</span> <span begin="28.025" end="28.185">on</span> <span begin="28.185" end="28.345">a</span> <span begin="28.345" end="28.678">summer</span> <span begin="28.678" end="28.954">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">金色星光，宛如夏夜绽放的烟火</span></p><p begin="28.954" end="34.516" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.954" end="29.259">The</span> <span begin="29.259" end="29.579">way</span> <span begin="29.579" end="29.799">that</span> <span begin="29.799" end="30.111">when</span> <span begin="30.111" end="30.271">I</span> <span begin="30.381" end="31.039">fall,</span> <span begin="31.039" end="31.279">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="31.279" end="31.999">there</span> <span begin="31.999" end="32.199">to</span> <span begin="32.199" end="32.679">carry</span> <span begin="32.679" end="34.516">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当我跌倒，你总在身旁将我托起</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="28.954" end="31.039"><span begin="28.954" end="29.259">(The</span> <span begin="29.259" end="29.579">way</span> <span begin="29.579" end="29.799">that</span> <span begin="29.799" end="30.111">when</span> <span begin="30.111" end="30.271">I</span> <span begin="30.381" end="31.039">fall)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当我跌倒，你总在身旁将我托起</span></span></p><p begin="34.910" end="38.732" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.910" end="35.686">西</span><span begin="35.686" end="37.255">風</span><span begin="37.588" end="37.748">う</span><span begin="37.748" end="38.188">た</span><span begin="38.188" end="38.732">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">西风轻唱</span></p><p begin="38.976" end="42.891" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.976" end="39.650">星</span><span begin="39.650" end="40.010">降</span><span begin="40.010" end="41.471">り</span><span begin="41.471" end="42.032">注</span><span begin="42.032" end="42.891">ぐ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">繁星洒落</span></p><p begin="43.107" end="47.202" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.107" end="43.333">そ</span><span